      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正当我导览结束，稍作休息时──\n鲁道夫象征来到我的身旁，并询问了今天的经过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2653833ba20169dfe80ba1ad2276e931f16ab1ead51b7b74edeccd161c71acdc",
